    },
    "body": "The retained bridge masters learned a conditional H4 action map, but quarter-grid export erased every relative coefficient and produced a fixed antipodal action. Gain-four recompilation restored conditional actions while preserving only305/960 master winners.\n\nAdd an opt-in categorical compiler to the existing offline export probe. It encodes each original-master winner using the existing strict-Q4 artifact and integer/H4 runtime. It requires parent byte reproduction, independent derived-artifact reload,960 exact action checks and115200 signed query-frame transport checks. Encoded coefficients are categorical markers, not learned confidence. Existing gain-four behavior remains the default; no fitting, label reads, scale search or serving arithmetic change.\n\nReferences #820. Independent exact-source review READY at SHA491d06518c47427a6c71ddb033ea85929013b0c90bdfe3604af8a4e398073f18. Rustfmt/diffcheck PASS. Linux pod CPU build/tests/probe underway at exact7518f2ee; execution results pending. This is a one-file child of the existing native Generate branch; parent-chain validation and delivery remain separate. No attention/language or main-merge qualification.\n",
